---
// src/pages/products/litecast/changelog.astro
// HEK75 ARCADE OS — LiteCast Detailed Changelog & Release Notes Archive.

import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="LiteCast v1.0.1 Changelog // Release Notes — HEK75 OS"
  description="LiteCast v1.0.1 release notes: Windows PE security, Authenticode code signing, search index cleanup, and in-app toast notifications by Harun Emrecan Karabağ."
  activeNav="products"
  footerLeft="LITECAST // RELEASE ARCHIVE v1.0.1"
  footerRight="HEK75 OS // ARCHIVE.LOG"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "HOME", url: "/" },
    { name: "PRODUCTS", url: "/products/" },
    { name: "LITECAST", url: "/products/litecast/" },
    { name: "CHANGELOG", url: "/products/litecast/changelog/" }
  ]}
>
  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumbs" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList">
    <span itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">
      <a href="/" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">HOME</span></a>
      <meta itemprop="position" content="1" />
    </span>
    <span class="breadcrumb-separator">/</span>
    <span itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">
      <a href="/products/" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">PRODUCTS</span></a>
      <meta itemprop="position" content="2" />
    </span>
    <span class="breadcrumb-separator">/</span>
    <span itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">
      <a href="/products/litecast/" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">LITECAST</span></a>
      <meta itemprop="position" content="3" />
    </span>
    <span class="breadcrumb-separator">/</span>
    <span itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">
      <span class="breadcrumb-current" itemprop="name">CHANGELOG</span>
      <link itemprop="item" href="https://hek75.com/products/litecast/changelog/" />
      <meta itemprop="position" content="4" />
    </span>
  </nav>

  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <div class="code">SOFTWARE RELEASE LOG // LITECAST.EXE</div>
      <h1>LITECAST v1.0.1 CHANGELOG</h1>
    </div>
    <span class="meta">BUILD 1.0.1.0 // STABLE</span>
  </div>

  <div class="panel" style="margin-bottom: 24px; border-left: 3px solid var(--green);">
    <div class="code" style="color: var(--yellow); margin-bottom: 6px;">RELEASE SUMMARY // 2026</div>
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: var(--green); font-size: 20px;">
      Security, Indexing & Interface Polish
    </h2>
    <p class="muted" style="line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; font-size: 14px;">
      LiteCast v1.0.1 introduces vital reliability and security enhancements, enforcing official Windows PE metadata, Authenticode code signing, refined desktop search indexing, and real-time in-app toast notifications.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-grid">
    <!-- Section 1: Windows Security & PE Info -->
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="code" style="color: var(--yellow); margin-bottom: 8px;">MODULE 01 // SECURITY & METADATA</div>
      <h3 style="color: var(--green); margin-top: 0;">Windows Security & PE Version Info</h3>
      <ul style="color: #7fa483; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 18px; margin: 0;">
        <li>
          <b style="color: #dbffde;">Official Publisher & Copyright Metadata:</b> Both <code class="code" style="color: var(--green);">LiteCast.exe</code> and <code class="code" style="color: var(--green);">LiteCast-Setup.exe</code> binaries now embed official PE version information (Company: <i>LiteCast Team</i>, Product: <i>LiteCast</i>, Copyright: <i>Copyright © 2026 LiteCast Team</i>, Version: <i>1.0.1.0</i>).
        </li>
        <li>
          <b style="color: #dbffde;">Security Scanner Verification:</b> Integrated standard language tables and resource headers to ensure instant identity verification across Windows Explorer details and security scanners like VirusTotal.
        </li>
        <li>
          <b style="color: #dbffde;">Automated Authenticode Code Signing:</b> Integrated automated code signing using SHA-256 and official RFC-3161 DigiCert Timestamps into packaging scripts (<code class="code" style="color: var(--green);">build_installer.ps1</code>), along with <code class="code" style="color: var(--green);">create_dev_cert.ps1</code> for local test signing.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2: Search Indexing -->
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="code" style="color: var(--yellow); margin-bottom: 8px;">MODULE 02 // SEARCH & INDEXING</div>
      <h3 style="color: var(--green); margin-top: 0;">Search Index Sanitation & Verification</h3>
      <ul style="color: #7fa483; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 18px; margin: 0;">
        <li>
          <b style="color: #dbffde;">Uninstalled Ghost Applications Filtered:</b> Eliminated phantom web/protocol links for non-installed services (such as Spotify, Discord, Steam, ChatGPT, YouTube, and PC Manager) from polluting launcher search queries.
        </li>
        <li>
          <b style="color: #dbffde;">External Launcher Validation:</b> Strengthened client validation checks for Riot Games and secondary stores to ensure only locally installed games appear in indexed results.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 3: In-App Toast -->
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="code" style="color: var(--yellow); margin-bottom: 8px;">MODULE 03 // USER INTERFACE</div>
      <h3 style="color: var(--green); margin-top: 0;">In-App Real-Time Toast Notifications</h3>
      <ul style="color: #7fa483; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 18px; margin: 0;">
        <li>
          <b style="color: #dbffde;">In-Window Notification Pill:</b> Triggering a re-index from either search or settings produces an unobtrusive, retro-styled toast banner in the top-right corner of the launcher:
          <div style="margin: 8px 0; padding: 6px 10px; background: rgba(125, 255, 133, 0.1); border: 1px solid var(--green); border-radius: 4px; color: var(--green); font-size: 12px; display: inline-block;">
            [ &#x2714; Indexing complete &bull; X items indexed ]
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <b style="color: #dbffde;">Streamlined System Tray:</b> Replaced suppressed Windows 11 system tray balloon popups with in-app native toasts, decluttering tray context menus.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 4: Deployment & Distribution -->
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="code" style="color: var(--yellow); margin-bottom: 8px;">MODULE 04 // DEPLOYMENT & PIPELINE</div>
      <h3 style="color: var(--green); margin-top: 0;">Distribution & Packaging Pipeline</h3>
      <ul style="color: #7fa483; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 18px; margin: 0;">
        <li>
          <b style="color: #dbffde;">WinGet Manifest:</b> Updated <code class="code" style="color: var(--green);">winget/manifest.yaml</code> for v1.0.1 and registered official SHA-256 installer checksums.
        </li>
        <li>
          <b style="color: #dbffde;">Automated Update Registry:</b> Synchronized <code class="code" style="color: var(--green);">version.json</code> with the v1.0.1 release tag to notify active client installations.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Download & Return Actions -->
  <div style="margin-top: 36px; display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;">
    <a class="btn yellow" href="/downloads/litecast/LiteCast-Setup.exe" download>
      DOWNLOAD SETUP v1.0.1 (.EXE) ↗
    </a>
    <a class="btn blue" href="https://github.com/Hekyetmisbes/litecast" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      GITHUB REPOSITORY ↗
    </a>
    <a class="btn" href="/products/litecast/">
      &larr; RETURN TO LITECAST
    </a>
  </div>
</Layout>
